    Writes the document from *routes*, unless it was written already.
    *guarded* says whether the app has a guard, *note* the note that guard
    reads, and *closed* whether it asks for a token where a route says
    nothing. Many workers may ask at once: one of them writes. What comes
    back is what there is to warn of, a line for each route that the
    document could not hold, to the one that wrote it and to nobody after.
